<title>SINGAPORE: L&amp;M buys property for S$9.5 million.</title>
<headline>L&amp;M buys property for S$9.5 million.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engineering group L&amp;M Group Investments Ltd said on Friday it was buying a piece of property in Singapore for S$9.5 million from Petrolite Pacific Pte Ltd.</p>
<p>The property will be used for the manufacture, maintenance and storage of geotechnical engineering equipement and materials.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
